# Vercel only needs the API. Everything else is the Streamlit app, the scraper
# and the frontend, and shipping them makes the function bundle larger and the
# build slower for no benefit.
#
# static/ is the exception: the API serves the catalog images now, because the
# frontend deploys as its own project rooted at web/ and cannot read a
# directory outside that root. 12MB, and the CDN caches them after first hit.
web/
tests/
.github/
.streamlit/
scripts/
app.py
catalog_admin.py
storm_scraper.py
dedupe_products.py
download_images.py
optimize_images.py
